   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 335 of the laws of 2005 amending the education law relating to permitting the Madison-Oneida board of educational services to enter into contracts with the Madison Cortland ARC to provide transportation maintenance and repair services on buses, in relation to extending the provisions of such chapter",
    "basePrintNo": "S3776",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3776-2011",
